This document is a preliminary research record only. The following steps are proposed for counsel's consideration:

Disclosure request or third-party Norwich Pharmacal order directed at Trustpilot for internal records of {{NHB}} account, including full removal request history, any notices of non-compliance issued, and reviewer verification data.
Preservation request to Trustpilot for the current {{NHB}} profile data, to prevent alteration or deletion pending proceedings.
Consider instruction of an expert witness in digital platform fraud detection or consumer psychology to produce a CPR Part 35-compliant report based on the five indicators identified here, supported by the academic authorities cited above.
Counsel to advise on admissibility of the BBC Watchdog prior conduct material and its framing under CJA 2003 bad character provisions.
